id=openlist-runsv
name=openlist (runsv, no-mount)
version=4.2.6
versionCode=260901014
author=sorubedo(github)
description=OpenList as a runsv service for runsvdir-magisk. Tracks upstream OpenList. Default (no-mount) build keeps the core in the service folder and stores data in ./data; flash the mount build to ship the core at /system/bin/openlist and drop to the shell user on shared storage.
